#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/tools/pass_visualizer/core/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Core helpers for the pass visualizer: load a user TileLang kernel, capture "
"real compiler-pass executions, and render a PrimFunc's SBlock structure tree."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/tools/pass_visualizer/core/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"``StructureTreePassInstrument`` observes the canonical CUDA lowering "
"prologue through TVM's ``PassInstrument`` API.  The visualizer therefore "
"follows the passes that actually execute instead of maintaining a duplicate "
"pass list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/tools/pass_visualizer/core/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"The kernel file is taken as input; any ``@tilelang.jit`` kernel in the file "
"is auto-discovered. These helpers are consumed by ``viewer.py`` to emit an "
"interactive HTML pass browser."
msgstr ""

